rfall\n• Find Huntik Foundation master Seeker, Eathon Lambert"}],"full_text":"Fate of the Father was a mission assigned to the Huntik team to uncover the whereabouts of Eathon Lambert, the father of Lok Lambert, upon discovering his last known location from an Organization file. The Huntik Team travelled on the Huntik Foundation jet to South America to investigate the waterfall where Eathon and the Professor had their final battle. On the mission, they discovered Eathon was alive but trapped in the Spirit World, having used a Nexus to escape the Professor.\n\nObjectives\n\n• Investigate the waterfall\n• Find Huntik Foundation master Seeker, Eathon Lambert","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox mission\n|image=Fate_of_the_Father.jpg\n|location = [[Peru]]<br> [[South America]]\n|objectives = {{*}} Investigate the waterfall<br>{{*}} Find Huntik Foundation master [[Seeker]], [[Eathon Lambert]]\n|members = [[Dante Vale]]<br>[[Lok Lambert]]<br>[[Sophie Casterwill]]<br>[[Zhalia Moon]]\n|episode = \"[[Doorway to Huntik]]\"\n}}\n'''Fate of the Father''' was a mission assigned to the Huntik team to uncover the whereabouts of [[Eathon Lambert]], the father of [[Lok Lambert]], upon discovering his last known location from an [[the Organization|Organization]] file. The Huntik Team travelled on the [[Huntik Foundation jet]] to South America to investigate the waterfall where Eathon and [[the Professor]] had their final battle. On the mission, they discovered Eathon was alive but trapped in the [[Spirit World]], having used a [[Nexus]] to escape the Professor. \n\n==Objectives==\n* Investigate the waterfall\n* Find Huntik Foundation master [[Seeker]], Eathon Lambert\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation Missions]]","categories":["Huntik Foundation Missions"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:14456","status":"resolved","target_title":"Peru","label":"Peru","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Peru","href":"#/categories?name=Peru"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:19546","status":"resolved","target_ti